{"id":"dabe289b82d34117","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-continuous-semimeasure.md","title":"Effective Continuous Semimeasures","display":"df-continuous-semimeasure — Effective Continuous Semimeasures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure","aliases":["43-df-continuous-semimeasure"],"display":"df-continuous-semimeasure — Effective Continuous Semimeasures","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 10.1.8 and following maximal semimeasure construction","source_printed_pages":"208–209","source_pdf_pages":"228–229","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-continuous-semimeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-continuous-semimeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-continuous-semimeasure — Effective Continuous Semimeasures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 10.1.8 and following maximal semimeasure construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"208–209"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"228–229"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\">\\(m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空串，连接运算见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSC}\">\\(\\mathrm{LSC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow m(\\varepsilon)\\le1\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m(\\sigma)\\ge m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow m(\\varepsilon)\\le1\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m(\\sigma)\\ge m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以圆柱的有限串编码表达书中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m([\\sigma])\">\\(m([\\sigma])\\)</span>，连续半测度必须满足父节点质量不少于两子节点之和。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 10.1.8 and following maximal semimeasure construction；印刷页 208–209，PDF 页 228–229。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)$；$\\varepsilon$ 为空串，连接运算见 [[43-df-string]]，$\\mathrm{LSC}$ 见 [[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)$；$\\varepsilon$ 为空串，连接运算见 [[43-df-string]]，$\\mathrm{LSC}$ 见 [[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow m(\\varepsilon)\\le1\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;m(\\sigma)\\ge m(\\sigma0)+m(\\sigma1),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"m([\\sigma])","display":false}],"bytes":2155,"backlinks":[{"id":"e1843130733da3f0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma^*=2^{<\\omega}$；$\\mathrm{EffectiveContinuousSemimeasure}$ 见 [[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]]，$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。固定函数列 $(m_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}$，其中 $m_e:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,1]$，以及全函数 $q:\\mathbb N\\times\\Sigma^*\\times\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$，满足"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]] — Effective Continuous Semimeasures"},{"id":"04b222309e5248f2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalContinuousSemimeasure}$ 采用 [[43-df-continuous-semimeasure]] 的同名符号。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","cc3ac987908461b8"]}